The operational excellence and process optimization initiative requires close coordination across multiple business units and functional areas:

**Engineering Integration:**
The engineering team led by CTO Dr. Evelyn Reed provides technical oversight and R&D support. Key engineering dependencies include design specifications for AutoNav Logistics System, integration with GreenStream Hydrogen Initiative, and technology transfer from the Orion Logistics Center - Singapore. Engineering resources are allocated at 16% capacity, with critical path activities including system architecture design, prototype development, and validation testing.

