**Compliance and Legal:**
General Counsel James Park ensures regulatory compliance including export control requirements (POL-AERO-001), data privacy regulations (POL-SC-003), and environmental standards. Legal review is required for all customer contracts, supplier agreements, and intellectual property matters. Compliance costs are estimated at $3M annually.

