- Finalize supplier agreements with Quantum Dynamics Ltd and Atlas Freight Systems
- Submit regulatory filings for certification by 2025-10-03
- Conduct customer workshops with Metropolitan Transit Corp and SolarFuture Holdings

**Short-term Milestones (Next 90 days):**
